# --- AXIAM C SDK build artifacts ---
# `build/` alone was not enough: CI builds the same tree three more times, under
# build-asan/ and build-vg/ for the sanitizer and valgrind legs, and a committed
# CMakeCache.txt from one of those fails the NEXT machine's configure step with
# "the current CMakeCache.txt directory is different than the directory where
# CMakeCache.txt was created". The glob covers every out-of-source tree.
build/
build-*/
docs/html/
docs/
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov
coverage*.info
coverage*.json
coveralls.json
coverage.txt
tests/pki/
